Cell["The spatial family: ArrayGraphics3D", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"0f2c8bb6-5053-eb40-bdd6-5eea7c18b266"],

Cell["\<\
The same arrays, as cubes arranged in space. At order one a line of cubes, at \
order two a plane of them:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8b1a1382-d6c3-e14f-a574-fb4d944b05d0"],

